{
 "_note": "DRAFT (user request 2026-10-19): the taxonomy view groups v2 tags by the mechanic they relate to, not by category. A tag can sit in more than one group. 'theme:X' = every pattern of theme X in taxonomy_crosswalk.json (plus Involves::X); other entries are tag patterns ('Cat::*' = the whole category). build-data checks that every v2 value lands in at least one group.",
 "groups": [
  { "name": "Attack Effects", "include": ["theme:Attack", "theme:Dodge", "theme:Critical", "theme:Intercept", "Actions::Limit Repeats"] },
